[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 117 Tommy's breakfast Listen to the tape",
    "start": 0.77,
    "end": 9.335,
    "zh": "第117课 汤米的早餐 听录音",
    "zh_hant": "第117課 湯米的早餐 聽錄音"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "then answer this question.",
    "start": 9.615,
    "end": 12.356,
    "zh": "然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "What does she mean by 'change'",
    "start": 13.457,
    "end": 16.978,
    "zh": "她说的“零钱”是什么意思",
    "zh_hant": "她說的“零錢”是什麼意思"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "in the last sentence?",
    "start": 17.059,
    "end": 19.199,
    "zh": "在最后一句中？",
    "zh_hant": "在最後一句中？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "When my husband was going",
    "start": 21.241,
    "end": 24.202,
    "zh": "当我丈夫正要",
    "zh_hant": "當我丈夫正要"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "into the dining room",
    "start": 23.942,
    "end": 25.963,
    "zh": "走进餐厅",
    "zh_hant": "走進餐廳"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "this morning,",
    "start": 25.613,
    "end": 26.923,
    "zh": "今天早上时，",
    "zh_hant": "今天早上時，"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "he dropped some coins on the floor.",
    "start": 27.124,
    "end": 30.665,
    "zh": "他掉了一些硬币在地上。",
    "zh_hant": "他掉了一些硬幣在地上。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "There were coins everywhere.",
    "start": 31.606,
    "end": 34.487,
    "zh": "到处都是硬币。",
    "zh_hant": "到處都是硬幣。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "We looked for them, but we could not find",
    "start": 34.888,
    "end": 39.109,
    "zh": "我们找过它们，但没能找到",
    "zh_hant": "我們找過它們，但沒能找到"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "them all.",
    "start": 38.759,
    "end": 39.95,
    "zh": "所有的。",
    "zh_hant": "所有的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "While we were having breakfast,",
    "start": 41.131,
    "end": 44.152,
    "zh": "当我们正在吃早餐时，",
    "zh_hant": "當我們正在吃早餐時，"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "our little boy, Tommy,",
    "start": 44.373,
    "end": 47.214,
    "zh": "我们的小男孩，汤米，",
    "zh_hant": "我們的小男孩，湯米，"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "found two small coins",
    "start": 47.514,
    "end": 50.416,
    "zh": "找到了两枚小硬币",
    "zh_hant": "找到了兩枚小硬幣"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "on the floor.",
    "start": 50.176,
    "end": 51.516,
    "zh": "在地上。",
    "zh_hant": "在地上。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "He put them both into his mouth.",
    "start": 52.517,
    "end": 56.138,
    "zh": "他把它们都放进了嘴里。",
    "zh_hant": "他把它們都放進了嘴裡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "We both tried to get the coins,",
    "start": 57.099,
    "end": 60.461,
    "zh": "我们俩都试图拿回硬币，",
    "zh_hant": "我們倆都試圖拿回硬幣，"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "but it was too late.",
    "start": 60.461,
    "end": 63.162,
    "zh": "但太晚了。",
    "zh_hant": "但太晚了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Tommy had already",
    "start": 63.482,
    "end": 66.303,
    "zh": "汤米已经",
    "zh_hant": "湯米已經"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "swallowed them!",
    "start": 66.324,
    "end": 68.044,
    "zh": "把它们吞下去了！",
    "zh_hant": "把它們吞下去了！"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Late that morning,",
    "start": 69.865,
    "end": 71.766,
    "zh": "那天上午晚些时候，",
    "zh_hant": "那天上午晚些時候，"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "when I was doing the housework,",
    "start": 71.786,
    "end": 75.128,
    "zh": "当我正在做家务时，",
    "zh_hant": "當我正在做家務時，"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "My husband phoned me from the office.",
    "start": 75.388,
    "end": 79.51,
    "zh": "我丈夫从办公室打电话给我。",
    "zh_hant": "我丈夫從辦公室打電話給我。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "'How's Tommy?'",
    "start": 80.292,
    "end": 81.813,
    "zh": "“汤米怎么样？”",
    "zh_hant": "“湯米怎麼樣？”"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "he asked.",
    "start": 81.973,
    "end": 83.274,
    "zh": "他问道。",
    "zh_hant": "他問道。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "'I don't know,' I answered,",
    "start": 82.935,
    "end": 86.939,
    "zh": "“我不知道，”我回答，",
    "zh_hant": "“我不知道，”我回答，"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "'Tommy's been to the toilet",
    "start": 87.44,
    "end": 90.002,
    "zh": "“汤米去了厕所",
    "zh_hant": "“湯米去了廁所"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "three times this morning,",
    "start": 89.983,
    "end": 92.365,
    "zh": "今天早上三次了，",
    "zh_hant": "今天早上三次了，"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "but I haven't had any change yet!'",
    "start": 92.626,
    "end": 96.61,
    "zh": "但我还没看到任何零钱呢！”",
    "zh_hant": "但我還沒看到任何零錢呢！”"
  }
]
